& [Purpose]
  + form SWA-03 as a pure provider-free lifecycle and checkpoint validator over one exact published SWA-02 proposal
  + bind work-step identity causal readiness stopped resumable failed awaiting-review and complete without executing or authorizing work

& [ProfilesAndInput]
  + [SWL-001] profiles are cantor-self-work-lifecycle-request/0.1 cantor-self-work-lifecycle-checkpoint/0.1 cantor-self-work-lifecycle-transition/0.1 and cantor-self-work-lifecycle-proposal/0.1 with closed deterministic JSON
  + [SWL-002] request embeds and revalidates the complete exact ObjectiveWorkPlanProposal
  + [SWL-003] lifecycle identity proposed agent-session identity objective plan and authority digests correspond exactly
  + [SWL-004] finite bounds do not exceed boot maximum checkpoints plan maximum steps update ceiling or session timeout

& [StepLifecycle]
  + [SWL-005] every plan step appears exactly once with the same identity ordinal class dependencies and requested capabilities
  + [SWL-006] states are pending_dependencies ready_awaiting_admission active stopped resumable failed awaiting_review and complete
  + [SWL-007] failed stopped resumable awaiting_review and complete remain non-substitutable
  + [SWL-008] BEGIN makes only dependency-free steps ready_awaiting_admission and all others pending_dependencies
  + [SWL-009] a step becomes ready only after every exact dependency is complete
  + [SWL-010] at most one step is active and active requires a future exact capability-admission receipt profile that SWA-03 cannot issue

& [CheckpointAndTransitions]
  + [SWL-011] checkpoint binds request digest sequence predecessor digest state map transition ledger evidence unresolved account and checkpoint digest
  + [SWL-012] every supplied transition binds one step predecessor state successor state causal predecessor checkpoint and bounded evidence
  + [SWL-013] stopped may become resumable but neither state is complete and resume retains the exact stopped checkpoint lineage
  + [SWL-014] failed is terminal for its attempt; retry requires a new attributable attempt identity and explicit predecessor
  + [SWL-015] awaiting_review may become complete only through an exact future verifier or reviewer receipt profile that SWA-03 cannot issue
  + [SWL-016] equal BEGIN validation and equal supplied-transition validation replay byte-identically

& [AuthorityAndFaults]
  + [SWL-017] all eight OWP capabilities remain not_granted_pending_contract until their exact external receipt validators exist
  + [SWL-018] lifecycle identity is representational and proves no physical observation execution update review publication or authorship
  + [SWL-019] profile boot objective plan step dependency state transition capability evidence correspondence bound and digest faults are typed
  + [SWL-020] unknown fields stale checkpoints illegal transitions authority laundering forged completion and digest mutation refuse atomically

& [Acceptance]
  + [SWL-A01] source audit canonical explosion review signature plan matrix and lock bind exactly
  + [SWL-A02] positive fixtures cover BEGIN dependency release stopped resumable failed awaiting-review and complete representations
  + [SWL-A03] adversarial fixtures refuse predecessor state dependency capability reviewer evidence output and machine-form substitution
  + [SWL-A04] focused debug release lint format workspace evidence attribution publication and replay gates pass

& [Delineation]
  + lifecycle identity pure state transition checkpoint validation and future-receipt correspondence are inside
  + objective judgment procedure compilation capability issuance workspace read mutation test execution review performance commit push provider effects SOP authorship signature activation persistence remote FPGA and Minecraft are outside

